    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this immersive simulation you will go from a novice trader to a highly respected business person. Start off living in the shame of poverty and use what little you have to make your start as an entrepreneur in the yard sale world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy items from various places around town. Find great deals at yard sales. Visit the flea market for rare finds. Learn how to spot a deal or a fake. Save up your cash to test your luck at the daily storage auction or find a great deal online on the Flippin' Marketplace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clean Dirty Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items are in rough shape but its nothing a good cleaning won't fix. Dirty items are harder to inspect but often come at a discount. Make them shine to attract new customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416350/extras/8e475214c7afae197d5b46efbc463eeb.poster.avif?t=1748813228\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416350/extras/8e475214c7afae197d5b46efbc463eeb.webm?t=1748813228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416350/extras/8e475214c7afae197d5b46efbc463eeb.mp4?t=1748813228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Repair Damaged Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You got your new item home to clean up but oh no it's damaged. Have no fear. With the right tools and know-how you can fix that up no problem. <br>Repair cracked items with our easy to use system. With just a can of putty and a little know-how you can have it fixed up in  a jiff. <br>Polish your repair skills to unlock new tools, fix more, clean faster, clean and repair on the go\u00a0 and get the most profit out of each item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416350/extras/fd4a8b0e1480f819a943448fd1fc06d9.poster.avif?t=1748813228\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416350/extras/fd4a8b0e1480f819a943448fd1fc06d9.webm?t=1748813228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416350/extras/fd4a8b0e1480f819a943448fd1fc06d9.mp4?t=1748813228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rank Up Your Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience as you fix up items allowing you to use the best tools in town.   <br>Buy and sell to gain experience unlocking  more business opportunities.  <br>Run, peddle, dumpster dive, dig up treasure and magnet fish to improve your stamina and open up new transportaion opportunities.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scavenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find lost treasure in many different places around town. Explore to find new equipment to help you find even more.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dumpster dive<br></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metal detect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magnet fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick locks<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Housing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in your humble trailer in Trout River Trailer park. Buy and sell to prove yourself as a worthy tenant to open up new rental opportunites, or save up all your cash and buy a place to really make your own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire Employees</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head over to the Tool Store and pick up a work station to expand your yard sale empire. Work stations must be placed on a rented or owned property, with each location providing different amounts of potential employees with varying skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything must go! Everything in town can be refurbished and sold for a hefty profit. Get ready to yard sale! Unload valuable items online on the Flippin' Marketplace for even more profit. Grab an office set up from the post office and see what people are looking to buy today.</p></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this immersive simulation you will go from a novice trader to a highly respected business person. Start off living in the shame of poverty and use what little you have to make your start as an entrepreneur in the yard sale world. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy items from various places around town. Find great deals at yard sales. Visit the flea market for rare finds. Learn how to spot a deal or a fake. Save up your cash to test your luck at the daily storage auction or find a great deal online on the Flippin' Marketplace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clean Dirty Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items are in rough shape but its nothing a good cleaning won't fix. Dirty items are harder to inspect but often come at a discount. Make them shine to attract new customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416350/extras/8e475214c7afae197d5b46efbc463eeb.poster.avif?t=1748813228\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416350/extras/8e475214c7afae197d5b46efbc463eeb.webm?t=1748813228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416350/extras/8e475214c7afae197d5b46efbc463eeb.mp4?t=1748813228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Repair Damaged Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You got your new item home to clean up but oh no it's damaged. Have no fear. With the right tools and know-how you can fix that up no problem. <br>Repair cracked items with our easy to use system. With just a can of putty and a little know-how you can have it fixed up in  a jiff. <br>Polish your repair skills to unlock new tools, fix more, clean faster, clean and repair on the go\u00a0 and get the most profit out of each item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416350/extras/fd4a8b0e1480f819a943448fd1fc06d9.poster.avif?t=1748813228\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416350/extras/fd4a8b0e1480f819a943448fd1fc06d9.webm?t=1748813228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416350/extras/fd4a8b0e1480f819a943448fd1fc06d9.mp4?t=1748813228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rank Up Your Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience as you fix up items allowing you to use the best tools in town.   <br>Buy and sell to gain experience unlocking  more business opportunities.  <br>Run, peddle, dumpster dive, dig up treasure and magnet fish to improve your stamina and open up new transportaion opportunities.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scavenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find lost treasure in many different places around town. Explore to find new equipment to help you find even more.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dumpster dive<br></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metal detect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magnet fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick locks<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Housing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in your humble trailer in Trout River Trailer park. Buy and sell to prove yourself as a worthy tenant to open up new rental opportunites, or save up all your cash and buy a place to really make your own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire Employees</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head over to the Tool Store and pick up a work station to expand your yard sale empire. Work stations must be placed on a rented or owned property, with each location providing different amounts of potential employees with varying skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything must go! Everything in town can be refurbished and sold for a hefty profit. Get ready to yard sale! Unload valuable items online on the Flippin' Marketplace for even more profit. Grab an office set up from the post office and see what people are looking to buy today.</p></p></li></ul>",
